  {
    "screen": "vault-tool-maintenance-recovery-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "改密：在已接通本机 vault-workflow 的 AI 对话中指定库，用技能的 ChangePassword，本人在本地提供旧凭据。迁移格式用核心命令 `migrate`，扩容或换密钥文件用 `rebuild --out` 生成新副本，清理旧备份用本机终端菜单；AI 技能没有这几项的模式，AI 可以帮我准备对应的本地步骤，但不会虚构一个通用维护窗口。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **分清维护目标**　确认当前格式、层次和旧库位置，说明本次会生成哪份新库以及保留哪些旧文件。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
